  "description": "Replacement of existing BT Street Hub Unit with of 1No. BT Street Hub Unit and associated internally illuminated advertisement panels on either side of the unit.\r",
  "development_type": "Other advertisements",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "(1) Any advertisement displayed and any site used for the display of advertisements shall be maintained in a condition that does not impair the visual amenity of the site.\r \r(2) Any structure or hoarding erected or used principally for the purpose of displaying advertisements shall be maintained in a safe condition.\r \r(3) Where an advertisement is required under these Regulations to be removed, the site shall be left in a condition that does not endanger the public or impair visual amenity.\r \r(4) No advertisement is to be displayed without the permission of the owner of the site or any other person with an interest in the site entitled to grant permission.\r \r(5) No advertisement shall be sited or displayed so as to:\r \r(a) endanger persons using any highway, railway, waterway, dock, harbour or aerodrome (civil or military);\r(b) obscure, or hinder the ready interpretation of any traffic sign, railway signal or aid to navigation by water or air; or\r(c) hinder the operation of any device used for the purpose of security or surveillance or for measuring the speed of any vehicle\r \rReason: As required by regulation 2(1) and Schedule 2 of the Town & Country Planning (Control of Advertisements) (England) Regulations 2007.\r \r(6) The intensity of illumination shall be controlled at a level that is within the limit recommended by the Institution of Lighting Professionals technical guidance note PLG05 \"The brightness of illuminated advertisements\" 2023\r \r(7) The illumination of the signs hereby approved shall not at any time be intermittent.\r\t \rReason: In the interests of amenity and highway safety.\r",
    "The development hereby permitted shall be carried out in accordance with the approved plans:\r\t\rENF9/LIB/XX/XX/DR/LD/1000/D5\rENF9/LIB/XX/XX/DR/LD/1300/D5\rENF9/LIB/XX/XX/DR/LD/2100/D5\t\rENF9/LIB/XX/XX/DR/LD/2300/D5\rENF9/LIB/XX/XX/DR/LD/2301/D5\rENF9/LIB/XX/XX/DR/A/9000/D5\rBT Street Hub Unit Dimensions\rPlanning Statement\rCover Letter\rStreet Hub Anti-Social Behaviour Management Plan\rStreet Hubs Beyond connection\r\rReason: For the avoidance of doubt and in the interests of proper planning.\r"
  ],
